# Apex Digital Solutions LLC — T4 Customizing
# Run from T4-Customizing/ directory
# Prerequisite: T1 Bootstrap completed

# Step 1: Create the L2 Apex.Payroll regulation in Apex.DigitalSolutions tenant
PayrollImport Apex.Payroll.2026.json

# Step 2: Add L2 layer to all three payrolls
PayrollImport PayrollsWithL2.json

# Step 3: Set transit benefit for NYC-based employees (Sara, Carlos, Linda)
PayrollImport CaseValues/TransitBenefit-NYC.json

# Step 4: Set WFH equipment stipend for remote employees (Kevin, Jessica)
PayrollImport CaseValues/WFHStipend-Remote.json
